                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "After the first playthrough, a bit surprised that the game can be released in china.\nthe two search engine (google and baidu) give very different results, just like in real life.\nyou can see in those news, the story is happened in usa, but obviously.....\n\nthe game also talk about situation of gaming industry, and many nice touch there.\n\nglad that chinese have developer like you. i hope you can keep making games, to make more chinese understand what place they are living in.\n\n這遊戲很多地方都很隱晦, 但稍為熟悉國情的人都應該知道在說甚麼\n\n諷刺即荒謬",
